<title>FRANCE: French May industry general outlook falls - survey.</title>
<headline>French May industry general outlook falls - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following seasonally adjusted data.</p>
<p>A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>					May   Apr  Mar  Feb  Jan  Dec Nov</p>
<p> Recent past output		 7     7    2    2   -2    3  -2</p>
<p> Finished product stocks	 14    13   16   18   18   18  20</p>
<p> Overall orders and demand    -17   -22  -16  -20  -29  -26 -27</p>
<p> Foreign orders and demand	3    -4    0    0   -5   -2  -4</p>
<p> Future output (overall)	 -7    -3    0    6    1  -14 -21</p>
<p> Future output (personal)	 9     8    7   13   11    5   4</p>
<p> Future prices (overall)	-11   -12  -13  -11  -13  -21 -25</p>
<p> Future prices (personal)	-5    -7  -11  -10  -23  -23 -14</p>
<p>Recent past output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	     6    11   23   26   12   25   8</p>
<p> Energy				 -     -    -    -  -86   -4  -7</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     7     7    2    2   -2    3  -2</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	     10     6    5    0  -10   -5  -3</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	11    14    6    3   14   11  -3</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-11     5  -39  -28  -37  -47 -44</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     6     2   -3   -2    0   16  10</p>
<p>Future output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	    25    17   29   16  -12   10   8</p>
<p> Energy				 -     -    -    -  -86    2  -7</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     9     8    7   13   11    5   4</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	     11     8    9   13   11    0   5</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	20    23   23   15    9   15   3</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	 13    15  -22   22   19   -8 -29</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     2     6   10    7    4   -4  10</p>
